<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU" class="no-js">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script>document.documentElement.className=' js';</script>
<title>CM Plumbing — Blocked Drains, Hot Water &amp; Repairs | All Things Plumbing</title>
<meta name="description" content="CM Plumbing — all things plumbing, done right. Blocked drains, hot water systems, leaks, tap repairs and bathroom renovations. Reliable local plumber. Get a free quote.">
<meta property="og:title" content="CM Plumbing — All Things Plumbing">
<meta property="og:description" content="Blocked drains, hot water systems, leaks and repairs. Reliable local plumbing, done right. Get a free quote.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="images/logo.jpg">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@500;600;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Montserrat:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
<noscript><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@500;600;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Montserrat:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"></noscript>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#F4F7FB;
  --paper:#FFFFFF;
  --paper2:#EDF2F9;
  --ink:#0A1530;
  --ink2:#5A6679;
  --acc:#1A4395;
  --acc2:#23A8E1;
  --acc-ink:#FFFFFF;
  --line:#DCE5F0;
  --chip:#E8EFF8;
  --dark:#050217;
  --dink:#EAF2FB;
  --dmut:#9FB4D6;
  --font-display:'Archivo',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;
  --font-sans:'Inter',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;
  --fluid:clamp(44px,9vw,118px);
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.62;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:inherit}
.wrap{width:min(1180px,92vw);margin-inline:auto}
.mono{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}

html.js .rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition: opacity .45s ease-out,transform .7s ease-out}
html.js .rv.in,html.js .rv.on{opacity:1;transform:none}
html.js .rv.d1{transition-delay:.08s}
html.js .rv.d2{transition-delay:.16s}
html.js .rv.d3{transition-delay:.24s}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  html.js .rv{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}
  *{animation-duration:.001s!important;transition-duration:.001s!important}
}

/* === NAV === */
.nav{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;z-index:60;background:rgba(10,21,48,.96);-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);border-bottom:2px solid var(--acc2)}
.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.4rem;height:64px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;min-width:0}
.brand-mark{height:48px;width:auto;object-fit:contain}
.brand-txt,.brand .b-txt{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1;min-width:0}
.brand-name,.brand .comp-name{font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:1.18rem;line-height:1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#F4F8FD;white-space:nowrap}
.brand-sub,.brand .comp-sub{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;font-style:normal;color:#AFC0DE;white-space:nowrap}
.brand-sub em,.brand .comp-sub em{font-style:normal;opacity:1;color:var(--acc2)}
@media(max-width:680px){.nav-in{height:56px}.brand-mark{height:48px;width:auto;object-fit:contain}.brand-name,.brand .comp-name{font-size:1.02rem}.brand-sub,.brand .comp-sub{display:none}}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;list-style:none;margin-left:auto;align-items:center}
.nav-links a{color:#C6D4EA;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;transition:color .15s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:#fff}
.nav-cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--acc2);color:#04122E;font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.02em;transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.nav-cta a:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(4,18,46,.5)}
@media(max-width:680px){.nav-cta a{font-size:.72rem;padding:.5rem .8rem}}
#burger{display:none;background:none;border:0;color:#fff;font-size:1.5rem;cursor:pointer;padding:6px}
@media (max-width:680px){
  .nav-links{display:none;position:absolute;top:56px;left:0;right:0;flex-direction:column;gap:0;background:rgba(10,21,48,.98);padding:10px 0;border-bottom:2px solid var(--acc2)}
  .nav-links.open{display:flex}
  .nav-links a{padding:12px 24px}
  #burger{display:block;margin-left:auto}
}

/* === HERO === */
.hero{position:relative;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--dark) url('images/hero.jpg') right center/cover no-repeat;overflow:hidden;padding-top:96px;perspective:1400px}
.hero canvas{display:none}
.hero-in{position:relative;z-index:3;padding-block:9vh 4rem;transform:translateZ(0)}
.hero-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,2,23,.94) 0%,rgba(5,2,23,.84) 40%,rgba(5,2,23,.32) 100%);pointer-events:none;z-index:2}
@media (max-width:760px){.hero{background-position:center 62%}.hero-shade{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(5,2,23,.9) 0%,rgba(5,2,23,.72) 55%,rgba(5,2,23,.42) 100%)}.hero-in{padding-block:5vh 3rem}}
.kick{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--acc2);font-weight:700;background:rgba(35,168,225,.12);border:1px solid rgba(35,168,225,.35);padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px}
h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.6rem);line-height:1.04;color:#F6FAFF;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.02em;max-width:20ch;margin-top:1.4rem}
h1 .acc{color:var(--acc2)}
h1 .thin{display:block;font-size:.32em;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.65;color:#9FB4D6;margin-top:1rem;text-transform:uppercase}
.hero-sub{max-width:52ch;margin-top:1.8rem}
.hero-sub p{color:#CBD9EE;font-size:1.02rem}
.hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:1rem;margin-top:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:.92rem;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.btn-acc{background:var(--acc2);color:#04122E}
.btn-acc:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(4,18,46,.45)}
.btn-ghost{border:1.5px solid rgba(159,180,214,.5);color:#D9E4F5;background:transparent}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--acc2);color:#fff}
@media (max-width:640px){
  .hero{min-height:100vh}
  .nav-cta span{display:none}
}

/* === SECTIONS === */
.section{padding:88px 0}
.section-alt{background:var(--paper)}
.kick-sec{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--acc);font-weight:800}
.sec-head h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.6vw,2.6rem);line-height:1.12;color:var(--ink);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-top:.6rem;max-width:22ch}
.sec-head p{color:var(--ink2);max-width:56ch;margin-top:.8rem}
.grid{display:grid;gap:1.2rem}
.grid-4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
.grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.grid-2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
@media (max-width:920px){.grid-4,.grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media (max-width:600px){.grid-4,.grid-3,.grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.card{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:26px 24px;transition:transform .18s,box-shadow .18s}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(26,67,149,.10)}
.card .ic{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1A4395,#23A8E1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#04122E;font-weight:800;font-size:1.1rem;font-family:var(--font-display)}
.card h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;margin-top:.9rem}
.card p{color:var(--ink2);font-size:.92rem;margin-top:.45rem}

.step{display:flex;gap:1.1rem;align-items:flex-start}
.step .n{flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--dark);color:var(--acc2);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1rem}
.step h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700}
.step p{color:var(--ink2);font-size:.92rem;margin-top:.3rem}

.faq{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--paper);padding:20px 22px}
.faq summary{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem}
.faq summary::after{content:'+';font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--acc2);font-weight:700;transition:transform .15s}
.faq[open] summary::after{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.faq p{color:var(--ink2);font-size:.94rem;margin-top:.8rem}

.areas-pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem;margin-top:1.2rem}
.areas-pills span{padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--chip);color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;border:1px solid var(--line)}

/* === CTA band === */
.pitch-band{background:var(--dark);color:#EAF2FB;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.pitch-band::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-60%;right:-10%;width:520px;height:520px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(35,168,225,.25),transparent 65%);pointer-events:none}
.pitch-band h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,3rem);color:#fff;font-weight:900;max-width:18ch;line-height:1.08}
.pitch-band p{color:var(--dmut);max-width:52ch;margin-top:.8rem}
.pitch-band .btn{margin-top:1.8rem}

/* === FOOTER === */
footer{background:#050B1C;color:#93A7C8;padding:64px 0 24px;font-size:.92rem}
.foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:2.4rem}
@media (max-width:860px){.foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.foot-brand img{width:32px;height:32px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:8px}
.foot-brand .comp-name{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;color:#E7EEF9;font-size:1.05rem;display:block;margin-top:.7rem}
.foot-brand p{font-size:.85rem;margin-top:.5rem}
footer h4{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5F7AA6;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:1rem}
footer a{color:#93A7C8;text-decoration:none;display:block;padding:4px 0;transition:color .15s}
footer a:hover{color:var(--acc2)}
.footer-bar{border-top:1px solid rgba(147,167,200,.16);margin-top:2.6rem;padding-top:1.2rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.8rem;color:#5F7AA6}
</style>
<style id="lb-motion-css">
/* ==== LB MOTION PACK ==== */
.lb-rb,.lb-rb *,.lb-mq,.lb-mq *{box-sizing:border-box}
/* A header must never be hidden by a scroll-reveal state: the nav/brand is chrome, not
   content. Unrevealed .rv wrappers left whole headers at opacity:0 (invisible logo). */
header, .site-header, .page-header, nav.nav, .nav .rv, nav.rv, .header-inner, .nav-inner,
header .rv, .site-header .rv, .nav-inner .rv{
  opacity:1 !important; visibility:visible !important; transform:none !important;
}
.lb-rb{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#0c0d10}
.lb-mq{max-width:100%;overflow:hidden}
.lb-rb__track{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/7}
.lb-rb__slide{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;transition:opacity .9s ease;will-change:opacity}
.lb-rb__slide.is-on{opacity:1}
.lb-rb__slide img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transform:scale(1.03);transition:transform 7s linear}
.lb-rb__slide.is-on img{transform:scale(1.10)}
.lb-rb__cap{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:clamp(14px,2.2vw,30px);
 background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(6,7,10,.72));color:#fff;
 font-family:var(--lb-sub,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;
 font-size:clamp(9px,1vw,13px);z-index:2}
.lb-rb__dots{position:absolute;top:50%;right:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px);transform:translateY(-50%);
 display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;z-index:3}
.lb-rb__dots button{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);
 background:transparent;cursor:pointer;padding:0;transition:transform .25s,background .25s}
.lb-rb__dots button.is-on{background:#fff;transform:scale(1.35)}
.lb-rb__nav{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:3;width:44px;height:44px;
 border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);background:rgba(8,9,12,.35);color:#fff;
 cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:17px;line-height:1;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
 transition:background .25s,transform .25s}
.lb-rb__nav:hover{background:rgba(8,9,12,.7)}
.lb-rb__nav--prev{left:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px)}
.lb-rb__nav--next{right:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px)}
.lb-rb__nav:active{transform:translateY(-50%) scale(.92)}
@media (max-width:700px){.lb-rb__track{aspect-ratio:4/3}.lb-rb__nav{width:36px;height:36px}}

a.btn,.btn,button.btn,.nav-cta a,.wp-block-button__link{position:relative;overflow:hidden;
 transition:transform .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1),box-shadow .22s,filter .22s}
a.btn:hover,.btn:hover,button.btn:hover,.nav-cta a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);
 box-shadow:0 10px 24px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.55);filter:brightness(1.05)}
a.btn:active,.btn:active,button.btn:active,.nav-cta a:active{transform:translateY(0) scale(.985)}
a.btn::after,.btn::after,.nav-cta a::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:38%;
 left:-60%;background:linear-gradient(100deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.32),transparent);
 transform:skewX(-18deg);transition:left .55s ease;pointer-events:none}
a.btn:hover::after,.btn:hover::after,.nav-cta a:hover::after{left:130%}

.lb-rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1)}
.lb-rv.is-in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
 .lb-rv{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important;transition:none!important}
 .lb-rb__slide img{transform:none!important;transition:none!important}
 a.btn::after,.btn::after,.nav-cta a::after{display:none}
}

/* marquee band (professional, reference-derived) */
.lb-mq{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#0b0c10;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
 border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10)}
.lb-mq__in{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:lb-mq 34s linear infinite}
.lb-mq:hover .lb-mq__in{animation-play-state:paused}
.lb-mq__in span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(18px,3vw,44px);
 padding:clamp(11px,1.5vw,19px) clamp(14px,2vw,26px);color:#fff;font-family:var(--lb-disp,Inter),sans-serif;
 font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:clamp(11px,1.25vw,17px);white-space:nowrap}
.lb-mq__in span i{font-style:normal;color:var(--lb-acc,#e51924)}
@keyframes lb-mq{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.lb-mq__in{animation:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav class="nav" aria-label="Main">
  <div class="wrap nav-in">
    <a href="#top" class="brand" aria-label="CM Plumbing - Home">
      <img class="brand-mark" src="images/logo.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="eager">
      <span class="brand-txt b-txt"><b class="brand-name comp-name">CM Plumbing</b><i class="brand-sub comp-sub"><em>All</em> Things Plumbing</i></span>
    </a>
    <ul class="nav-links" id="navlinks">
      <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
      <li><a href="#process">How it works</a></li>
      <li><a href="#areas">Service area</a></li>
      <li><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="nav-cta"><a href="#quote">Free quote</a></div>
    <button id="burger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">&#9776;</button>
  </div>
</nav>
<script>(function(){var b=document.getElementById('burger'),n=document.getElementById('navlinks');if(!b||!n)return;b.addEventListener('click',function(){var o=n.classList.toggle('open');b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',o?'true':'false');b.setAttribute('aria-label',o?'Close menu':'Open menu');});})();</script>

<header class="hero" id="top">
<!-- LB-3D-HERO -->

<canvas id="heroCanvas" aria-hidden="true" hidden></canvas>
<div class="hero-shade"></div>
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    <span class="kick">All Things Plumbing</span>
    <h1>Plumbing, <span class="acc">fixed properly</span>, first time.<span class="thin">Blocked drains&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;Hot water&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;Leaks&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;Renovations</span></h1>
    <div class="hero-sub">
      <p class="rv d2">CM Plumbing is your local plumbing specialist: blocked drains cleared, hot water sorted fast, and leaks fixed for good. Tell us the problem, get a firm, no-obligation quote.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas rv d3">
        <a href="#quote" class="btn btn-acc">Get a free quote</a>
        <a href="#services" class="btn btn-ghost">See services</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main">
<section class="section" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="kick-sec">Services</span>
      <h2 id="services-h">All things plumbing, done right.</h2>
      <p>Every job starts with a clear diagnosis and finishes with a proper fix — tested, tidied and signed off.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-4" style="margin-top:2.4rem">
      <div class="card rv">
        <div class="ic">DR</div>
        <h3>Blocked Drains</h3>
        <p>Drain cleaning, CCTV camera inspections, tree-root clearing and blocked drain repairs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card rv">
        <div class="ic">HW</div>
        <h3>Hot Water Systems</h3>
        <p>Electric, gas, solar and heat pump systems — installation, repairs and replacements.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card rv">
        <div class="ic">LX</div>
        <h3>Leaks &amp; Tap Repairs</h3>
        <p>Tap repairs, toilet repairs, pipe replacements, burst pipe repairs and general maintenance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card rv">
        <div class="ic">RE</div>
        <h3>Renovations</h3>
        <p>Bathroom and kitchen plumbing, fixture installation and full renovation rough-in and fit-off.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt" id="process" aria-labelledby="process-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="kick-sec">How it works</span>
      <h2 id="process-h">From first call to sorted.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:2.4rem">
      <div class="step rv"><div class="n">1</div><div><h3>Tell us the problem</h3><p>Send a quick message about the issue — a photo and rough location help us quote accurately.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step rv"><div class="n">2</div><div><h3>Get a firm quote</h3><p>We confirm the job and give you a clear, no-obligation price before any work starts.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step rv"><div class="n">3</div><div><h3>Fixed &amp; tested</h3><p>The job is done properly, tested and cleaned up — so it stays fixed.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="areas" aria-labelledby="areas-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="kick-sec">Service area</span>
      <h2 id="areas-h">Local plumbing, local plumber.</h2>
      <p>Based locally and ready to help. Get in touch to confirm we cover your suburb.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="areas-pills rv">
      <span>Local area</span>
      <span>Residential</span>
      <span>Commercial</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-h">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="kick-sec">FAQ</span>
      <h2 id="faq-h">Asked on every job.</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;gap:.9rem;margin-top:2rem">
      <details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you provide free quotes?</summary><p>Yes — tell us about the job and we'll come back with a clear, no-obligation quote.</p></details>
      <details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you handle emergency plumbing?</summary><p>We prioritise urgent callouts — get in touch with a few details and we'll let you know the next available time.</p></details>
      <details class="faq rv"><summary>What areas do you service?</summary><p>We service our local area, residential and commercial. Message us to confirm your suburb.</p></details>
      <details class="faq rv"><summary>Can you repair existing fixtures?</summary><p>Yes — taps, toilets, pipework, hot water units and bathroom fixtures can all be repaired or replaced.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
